{
  "name": "dsh-bg-image",
  "version": "1.1.0",
  "description": "DSH Web/桌面 GUI 自定义背景图插件：入口在「插件/设置」页而非主界面，可自定义图片文件或图片 URL，并可设置大小（覆盖/包含/拉伸/自定义百分比/平铺）、位置（九宫格对齐 + 像素偏移）与透明度（图片透明度、模糊、亮度、蒙层、界面半透明）；纯浏览器半侧实现，零 bundle 补丁。",
  "keywords": [
    "deepseek",
    "deepseek-harness",
    "dsh",
    "dsh-plugin",
    "background",
    "wallpaper",
    "theme"
  ],
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "exports": {
    ".": "./lib/index.js",
    "./client": "./lib/client.js",
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/*.js",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "dsh": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    },
    "client": {
      "inject": [],
      "external": [
        "@deepseek-ai/dsh-client-ui-slots"
      ],
      "platform": "web"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@deepseek-ai/cordis": "^4.0.1"
  },
  "peerDependenciesMeta": {
    "react": {
      "optional": true
    }
  },
  "license": "MIT"
}
